  - `public LegendItemCollection getLegendItems()` (shared field(s): aggregatedItemsKey, aggregatedItemsPaint, dataExtractOrder, dataset, sectionPaints)
      doc: Returns a collection of legend items for the pie chart. @return The legend items.
  - `public boolean equals(Object obj)` (shared field(s): aggregatedItemsKey, aggregatedItemsPaint, dataExtractOrder, pieChart)
      doc: Tests this plot for equality with an arbitrary object.  Note that the plot's dataset is not considered in the equality test. @param obj  the object (<code>null</code> permitted). @return <code>true</code> if this plot is equal to <code>obj</code>, and <code>false</code> otherwise.
  - `private void prefetchSectionPaints()` (shared field(s): dataExtractOrder, dataset, sectionPaints)
      doc: For each key in the dataset, check the <code>sectionPaints</code> cache to see if a paint is associated with that key and, if not, fetch one from the drawing supplier.  These colors are cached so that the legend and all the subplots use consistent colors.
  - `private void readObject(ObjectInputStream stream) throws IOException, ClassNotFoundException` (shared field(s): aggregatedItemsPaint, sectionPaints)
      doc: Provides serialization support. @param stream  the input stream. @throws IOException  if there is an I/O error. @throws ClassNotFoundException  if there is a classpath problem.

